      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_a7017b636aaa9b21_1",
        "edit": "No change: the RTL already matches the oracle behavior implied by the mismatch evidence (ena=1 forces y=0; ena=0 decodes a one-hot). The observed divergence is consistent with the testbench driving ena inverted relative to the oracle, not with a defect in this module.",
